{"ref":"BDB, קֵן²","hw":"קֵן²","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">קֵן</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.6\">Dt 22:6</a> <strong>nest</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.14\">Is 10:14</a>; +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַן־</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.6\">Dt 22:6</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.11\">32:11</a>; +, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:14\" href=\"/Genesis.6.14\">Gn 6:14</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>nest</em>, of bird <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.6\">Dt 22:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:27\" href=\"/Job.39.27\">Jb 39:27</a>; in sim. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.14\">Is 10:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.8\">Pr 27:8</a>, of <em>nestlings</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.11\">Dt 32:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.2\">Is 16:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(קֵן מְשֻׁלָּח֑)</span>, perhaps also <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם־נִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:18\" href=\"/Job.29.18\">Jb 29:18</a>, but difficult, Che<sup>JQ July, 1897, 578</sup> proposes <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקֵן</span> or <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּזִקֻנַי</span> (cf. 𝔊); <em>nest</em> on high, of rock-dwellings <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:21\" href=\"/Numbers.24.21\">Nu 24:21</a> (JE) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.16\">Je 49:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:4\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.4\">Ob 4</a>; fig. of Chaldeans’ secure abode <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:9\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.9\">Hb 2:9</a>; temple as secure home for Isr. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:4\" href=\"/Psalms.84.4\">ψ 84:4</a> (fig. of swallow).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>cells</em>, like nests, in Noah’s ark <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:14\" href=\"/Genesis.6.14\">Gn 6:14</a> (P; read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנִּים קִנִּים</span>, so Lag Ol Bu<sup>Urg. 255</sup> Di Holz Gunk).","next":"BDB, קִנֵּן","prev":"BDB, קנן"}